Where: samdu/experiments, `topo-mascot-swift/Sources/TopoMascot` at 0a7718e (and its `Tests/TopoMascotTests/RestTests.swift` and `FacingTests.swift`), the Swift port of `topo-mascot-engine/topo-engine.js` at 240fda1
